\caption(Three separately initialized compact FCN models, each with a visible128-update Adam fit. Weighted CE excludes explicit L2; validation mean IoU selects each checkpoint independently.)
\alttext(Three separately initialized compact FCN models, each with a visible128-update Adam fit. Weighted CE excludes explicit L2; validation mean IoU selects each checkpoint independently.)

FCN-32s/16s/8s all select the final epoch 8,with validation mean IoU
.367674/.656522/.632153. Test mean IoU is .376401/.669480/.688770,
respectively. The finer skip variants improve this bounded fit,while32s
produces visibly coarse regions. All three were still improving when the
128-update runs stopped, and FCN8s still has its lowest IoU on circles
(.494061); these runs illustrate the architectures rather than establish
a benchmark ranking.

