> Conclusion

Full released graphs and every learned gradient are checked separately from compact training. Fit-only class weights,visible optimization and validation-selected restoration support held-out comparisons while retaining segmentation errors in the actual prediction galleries.

> References

- [Long,Shelhamer and Darrell(2015), Fully Convolutional Networks for Semantic Segmentation](https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.4038).
- [Authors’ released FCN models](https://github.com/shelhamer/fcn.berkeleyvision.org).
